[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0054","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-11405","title":"Tenda 多款路由器固件硬编码认证后门漏洞","description":"Tenda 多款路由器固件的 /bin/httpd 组件中存在硬编码认证后门漏洞。login() 函数在正常 MD5 密码验证失败后，会调用 GetValue(\"sys.rzadmin.password\") 从设备配置中读取预设后门密码，并与用户输入进行明文 strcmp() 比对，匹配即授予 role=2 管理员权限。该过程不校验用户名，任意用户名配合后门密码即可完成未授权登录。攻击者可通过 Web 管理界面直接利用此后门获取设备完全控制权，影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-11405"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T20:16:29Z","updated":"2026-07-08T14:16:54Z","remediation":"厂商暂未发布修复固件，建议立即在路由器管理界面中关闭远程Web管理功能，并将管理端口仅绑定到内网；如业务允许，将受影响设备隔离至独立VLAN并限制管理IP白名单；密切关注Tenda官方下载页面（tendacn.com/download）获取更新；长期建议更换为有安全维护支持的路由器设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/912.html","https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/213560","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/213560","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7f6823bc066973da81d3ae0684f0bccdfe7fa7a4/2026/CVE-2026-11405.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0d273a0b2821f58c8dfa9e9b4a2ad049f300e8ec/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-11405.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11405.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/278bea3f9397da219bb29098ecf3912d7bfe0645/content/posts/cve-2026-11405.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/fc4c6dee3389f7c2d92f9f682d5634871f9f8639/references/CVE-2026-11405-2026-07-06-2005","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/664cbcfd536cb5b218ad44ed120fbb123053c091/cve/CVE-2026-11405.html","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Tenda_%E5%A4%9A%E6%AC%BE%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%99%A8%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E7%A1%AC%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E5%90%8E%E9%97%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-11405.toml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a249095ad9c03821a47129e86556f58c2c639b88/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11405.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-w55r-jjxw-gxrx/GHSA-w55r-jjxw-gxrx.json","https://github.com/ekomsSavior/Jam_fi/blob/5c08af83f48920ff29bbe31d7af68e2214237e37/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-11405","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-11405"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0054.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0054.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0127","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0127.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-9181","title":"Esri ArcGIS Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Esri ArcGIS Server 存在目录遍历漏洞（CVE-2026-9181，CVSS 9.8），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的路径参数触发路径遍历，导致覆盖系统敏感文件。成功利用此漏洞可获得 ArcGIS Server 的完全管理员权限，对机密性、完整性和可用性造成严重影响。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 Linux 平台上 ArcGIS Server 12.0 及之前所有版本，ArcGIS Enterprise on Kubernetes 不受影响。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-9181"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T19:17:09Z","updated":"2026-07-08T15:16:32Z","remediation":"立即升级 ArcGIS Server 至 12.0 之后的最新版本（Esri 已于 2026 年 5 月安全公告中发布修复版本）。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层添加路径规范化规则，拦截包含 `../` 等目录遍历特征的请求参数；同时考虑迁移至 ArcGIS Enterprise on Kubernetes 平台，该部署形态不受此漏洞影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.esri.com/arcgis-blog/products/arcgis-enterprise/administration/may-2026-arcgis-security-bulletin","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2026/9xxx/CVE-2026-9181.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_3_CVE-2026-9181.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d40439944a245bd3d15d0e2034784cb651a6b55/2026/9xxx/CVE-2026-9181.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/7f750702dd329dbecdbaa92edda4acff71648134/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-9181/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/644985d2f6944ebfc351d3a58af338c527c434cf/content/posts/cve-2026-9181.md","https://github.com/Gatos90/security-llm-wiki/blob/c8d27f1e6ab2ce6bff111d2104bb306d7ef1bcb5/advisories/cve/CVE-2026-9181.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-07-09.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Esri_ArcGIS_Server_%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%E8%87%B4%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-9181.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-8h42-h5vq-h5gv/GHSA-8h42-h5vq-h5gv.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/57408b7c2bcf0fa671b0e4e3f1f5d07ab4ea9f8c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-9181-esri-arcgis-server-contains-a-directory-traversal-vulnerability.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-9181"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0127.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0127.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0637","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0637.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55798","title":"Pillow WindowsViewer 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"Pillow（Python 图像处理库）的 WindowsViewer.get_command() 方法在构造 cmd.exe 命令时，直接将文件路径嵌入 f-string 而未进行转义处理，随后通过 subprocess.Popen(..., shell=True) 执行。攻击者可通过构造包含双引号（\"）和连接符（&）等 shell 元字符的恶意文件路径，突破路径引号限制注入任意 cmd.exe 命令。该漏洞仅影响 Windows 平台（macOS/Linux 版本已正确使用 shlex.quote() 转义），需要攻击者能够控制文件路径且用户交互触发图像显示操作。CVSS 评分 4.5，危害等级中危。Pillow 12.3.0 版本已修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55798","GHSA-4x4j-2g7c-83w6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T19:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:58:33Z","remediation":"升级 Pillow 至 12.3.0 或更高版本，该版本在 WindowsViewer.get_command() 中对文件路径参数使用了 shlex.quote() 转义。如无法立即升级，避免在 Windows 系统上使用 WindowsViewer 处理不可信文件路径，或设置环境变量限制 shell 特殊字符传入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/blob/main/docs/releasenotes/12.3.0.rst","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/8404ea5fe5df40fc34aa1e51403dd6fce0778b8a","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/88194166691b7b603529b8b036ab3ab9cedd2de4","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/b0e06caa64c1405aa3da0bb1d2bd9a77ca22de7f","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-4x4j-2g7c-83w6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55798.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55798.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55798.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55798.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55798.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-55798.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55798.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-55798.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-55798.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-557xx/CVE-2026-55798.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0637.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0598","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0598.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55380","title":"Pillow 图像处理库 GD 格式解压炸弹防护绕过漏洞","description":"Pillow 图像处理库中 `PIL/GdImageFile.py` 的 `GdImageFile._open()` 方法在读取 GD 2.x 文件头的图像尺寸并存储到 `self._size` 时，未调用 `Image._decompression_bomb_check()` 进行解压炸弹防护检查。由于 `GdImageFile` 未向 `Image.register_open()` 注册，其自有入口 `PIL.GdImageFile.open(fp)` 直接实例化类，完全绕过了 Pillow 标准的 `Image.open()` 代码路径及其防护机制。攻击者仅需上传一个 1,037 字节的精心构造 `.gd` 文件（头部宽高均设为 65535），即可在调用 `.load()` 时触发约 4.3 GB 的 C 堆内存分配尝试，导致内存不足的系统进程崩溃，可循环请求造成持续拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Pillow 12.3.0 之前版本，CVSS 7.5 高危，无需认证和用户交互，任何接受用户上传 .gd 文件并调用 `GdImageFile.open()` 后跟 `.load()` 的服务均受影响。Pillow 12.3.0 已修复，补丁在 `_open()` 中补齐了缺失的 `_decompression_bomb_check()` 调用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55380","GHSA-phj9-mv4w-65pm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T19:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:58:54Z","remediation":"升级 Pillow 至 12.3.0 或更高版本：pip install --upgrade pillow。若使用系统包管理器，Ubuntu/Debian 执行 sudo apt update && sudo apt install python3-pillow，Alpine 执行 apk upgrade py3-pillow。临时缓解措施：在应用层拦截或校验 .gd 文件尺寸，避免直接调用 PIL.GdImageFile.open() 处理不可信来源的 GD 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/blob/main/docs/releasenotes/12.3.0.rst","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/f39b0ae6624eb2d7c5c5d651d9bb5fdbd96a8675","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-phj9-mv4w-65pm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55380.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55380.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/Pillow/CVE-2026-55380.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55380.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fb6b5b3f877cb85d43b44481d8426d9d97694f8/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-55380.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e9a4ab6839838576fc98bcb2ecd0e476425665f5/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-55380","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/16901ed3086419e92a3d59446e25736507cf6a0b/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55380.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/c3dfdc2468cdb0a89c10a40e310466fb77d5febc/content/posts/cve-2026-55380.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/bf66e61ceed5e250997657c9323c46b0c5917025/community/py3-pillow/APKBUILD","https://github.com/robusta-dev/robusta/blob/30d54eedd8e8de354e977d9b832b05e4879998cd/pyproject.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0598.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0597","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0597.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55379","title":"Pillow BdfFontFile 解压炸弹保护绕过拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pillow（Python 图像处理库）的 BdfFontFile.py 中 bdf_char() 函数在解析 BDF 字体文件时，直接从攻击者可控的 BBX 字段读取宽度和高度值并传递给 Image.new() 创建图像对象，但未调用 _decompression_bomb_check() 进行解压炸弹检测，导致绕过 Pillow 内置的像素数限制保护机制。远程攻击者可通过构造包含超大 BBX 尺寸（如 20000×20000）且 BITMAP 段为空的恶意 BDF 字体文件，触发该漏洞，使 Pillow 在未触发任何异常的情况下分配大量内存（单字形可达 50MB，多字形组合可达数 GB），最终导致目标服务因内存耗尽而拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Pillow 12.3.0 之前的所有版本，攻击无需身份认证和用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 Pillow 12.3.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55379","GHSA-45hq-cxwh-f6vc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T19:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:59:01Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pillow 至 12.3.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade pillow`）。如无法升级，在加载 BDF 字体前对不可信来源的字体文件进行预处理校验，限制 BBX 宽高乘积不超过 89478485 像素，或禁用 BDF 字体加载功能。同时监控进程内存使用，对异常大内存分配告警。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/blob/main/docs/releasenotes/12.3.0.rst","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/0a263e6264aa5399988d9acd3bbfbca2ca3ec77d","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-45hq-cxwh-f6vc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55379.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55379.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/Pillow/CVE-2026-55379.yml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fb6b5b3f877cb85d43b44481d8426d9d97694f8/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-55379.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e9a4ab6839838576fc98bcb2ecd0e476425665f5/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-55379","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/16901ed3086419e92a3d59446e25736507cf6a0b/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55379.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_3_CVE-2026-55379.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/c3dfdc2468cdb0a89c10a40e310466fb77d5febc/content/posts/cve-2026-55379.md","https://github.com/ogx-ai/ogx/blob/ebaaff8b17b8e3a7190c7b26565eda111659336c/pyproject.toml","https://github.com/aws-solutions/generative-ai-application-builder-on-aws/blob/483ace2fb897a5a862c7d51cb6dd41064220d18f/CHANGELOG.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0597.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0512","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0512.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54291","title":"PostgreSQL JDBC Driver 通道绑定认证静默降级漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL JDBC 驱动（pgjdbc）在 42.7.4 至 42.7.11 版本中存在通道绑定身份验证静默降级漏洞。当连接设置 `channelBinding=require` 时，攻击者通过拦截 TLS 连接并出示签名算法不支持 `tls-server-end-point` 通道绑定哈希的证书（如 Ed25519、Ed448 或后量子算法证书），可触发从 SCRAM-SHA-256-PLUS 到普通 SCRAM-SHA-256 的静默降级，从而绕过中间人攻击保护机制。该漏洞由两个问题共同导致：一是 bundled 的 scram-client 库在无法计算绑定哈希时返回空字节数组而非报错，二是 pgJDBC 的 ScramAuthenticator 仅检查服务器是否通告了 -PLUS 机制，未拒绝空绑定值也未验证协商后的机制实际使用了通道绑定。CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高，影响所有使用 `channelBinding=require` 的 PostgreSQL 数据库连接。升级至 42.7.12 或更高版本可修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54291","GHSA-j92g-9f8w-j867"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T19:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-09T13:16:25Z","remediation":"升级 pgJDBC 至 42.7.12 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，将 JDBC 连接参数 sslmode 设为 verify-full，并配置信任库仅包含服务端 CA 证书，以在 TLS 层阻止中间人攻击。注意：依赖 channelBinding=require 替代证书验证的连接无等效缓解措施，必须升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ongres/scram/releases/tag/3.3","https://github.com/pgjdbc/pgjdbc/commit/77df98e4e66c12936ded3478a0954f6f580bad99","https://github.com/pgjdbc/pgjdbc/security/advisories/GHSA-j92g-9f8w-j867","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54291.json","https://github.com/crate/crate/blob/9a55665e01f5539fac8c67fcc6a09651a528f21c/docs/appendices/release-notes/6.4.2.rst","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54291.json","https://github.com/pgjdbc/pgjdbc/blob/e9d062089de3ff5fb9e6cf7127a4b24063900d99/docs/content/changelogs/2026-06-29-42.7.12-release.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/maven/org.postgresql/postgresql/CVE-2026-54291.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54291.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54291.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54291.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0bde7ad241dd0e070c73be268acb78555be38fd9/cve/CVE-2026-54291.html","https://github.com/The-DevOps-Daily/devops-daily/blob/79c8827548077a126182306d29e822bae5ea6ea8/content/news/2026/week-28.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0512.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0451","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0451.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54060","title":"Pillow FontFile.compile 解压炸弹检查缺失导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pillow（Python 图像处理库）的 `PIL/FontFile.py` 中 `FontFile.compile()` 方法在将每个字形图像组装为组合位图时，调用 `Image.new(\"1\", (xsize, ysize))` 前未执行 `Image._decompression_bomb_check()` 解压炸弹检查。由于 `BdfFontFile` 和 `PcfFontFile` 未通过 `Image.open()` 注册，标准解压炸弹防护机制在字体加载路径中完全缺失。攻击者可构造包含 256 个超大字形（单个字形像素数低于告警阈值）的恶意 BDF/PCF 字体文件，通过 `to_imagefont()` 或 `save()` 触发 `compile()`，组合后位图像素数可达 134 亿（约 1.6 GB 内存分配），超过解压炸弹错误阈值 75 倍，导致服务端 OOM 崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Pillow 12.3.0 之前所有版本，无需身份认证即可远程触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54060","GHSA-5x94-69rx-g8h2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T19:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:58:45Z","remediation":"升级 Pillow 至 12.3.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade pillow`）。如无法立即升级，可在加载不可信字体文件前增加输入校验，限制 BDF/PCF 字体中每个字符的宽高不超过合理阈值（如 1024×1024），或在沙箱环境中处理字体文件以防止 OOM 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/blob/main/docs/releasenotes/12.3.0.rst","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/0a263e6264aa5399988d9acd3bbfbca2ca3ec77d","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-5x94-69rx-g8h2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54060.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54060.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/Pillow/CVE-2026-54060.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_3_CVE-2026-54060.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/1994996b0b1043aeb0b2d4db6d06b7a742460e16/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54060.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54060","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54060.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54060.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/8ecd0a8b6df901f448daf84fcdff97aa070dbb78/community/py3-pillow/APKBUILD","https://github.com/SolaceLabs/solace-agent-mesh/blob/f76d8972fecac522055e8195b704ec631c698c99/pyproject.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0451.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0450","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0450.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54059","title":"Pillow PcfFontFile 解压炸弹检测绕过漏洞","description":"Pillow 是一款 Python 图像处理库，其 PCF 字体文件加载函数 `PcfFontFile._load_bitmaps()` 在处理 PCF 字体文件的 METRICS 段时，直接从文件中读取字形尺寸（宽度和高度）并传递给 `Image.frombytes()`，但未调用 `Image._decompression_bomb_check()` 进行安全检查。攻击者可通过构造特制的 PCF 字体文件，将字形尺寸声明为最大 65535×131070 像素，导致单次加载即可分配高达 1.07GB 的堆内存，且每个字体文件可包含多个字形，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Pillow 12.3.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。由于 `PcfFontFile` 不通过 `Image.open()` 加载，因此完全绕过了原有的炸弹保护机制。修复版本为 12.3.0，用户应及时升级。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54059","GHSA-8v84-f9pq-wr9x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T19:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:58:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pillow 至 12.3.0 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade Pillow）。如无法升级，在加载不可信 PCF 字体文件前增加 _decompression_bomb_check() 调用，或使用 Image.open() 替代 PcfFontFile 直接加载。同时限制应用进程内存使用（如 systemd 的 MemoryLimit 或 Docker 的 --memory 参数）作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/blob/main/docs/releasenotes/12.3.0.rst","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/0a263e6264aa5399988d9acd3bbfbca2ca3ec77d","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-8v84-f9pq-wr9x","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54059.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54059.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/Pillow/CVE-2026-54059.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_3_CVE-2026-54059.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/1994996b0b1043aeb0b2d4db6d06b7a742460e16/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54059.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54059","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54059.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54059.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/8ecd0a8b6df901f448daf84fcdff97aa070dbb78/community/py3-pillow/APKBUILD","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/f555c0f654266a1e9da5c7e8fd8e7ef7b8ac0ebc/cve/CVE-2026-54059.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0450.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0057","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13753","title":"HP Deskjet 2800 系列打印机未授权访问漏洞","description":"HP Deskjet 2800 系列打印机嵌入式 Web 服务存在授权缺失漏洞，未经验证的远程攻击者可通过网络访问向暴露的管理 API 端点发送 GET 请求，获取明文 Wi-Fi Direct 凭据、设备唯一标识信息及管理员安全状态配置等敏感数据。该漏洞影响固件版本低于或等于 TBP1CN2612AR 的设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。受影响的设置页面在正常 Web 界面访问时需管理员认证，但底层 API 端点缺乏权限校验导致信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13753"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T19:16:55Z","updated":"2026-07-06T20:16:29Z","remediation":"立即将 HP Deskjet 2800 系列打印机固件升级至高于 TBP1CN2612AR 的版本，可通过 HP 官方支持网站下载最新固件。如无法立即升级，请在网络防火墙或路由器上限制仅允许受信任的管理 IP 地址访问打印机 80/443 端口，并禁用打印机 Web 服务的远程访问功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/828543","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/828543","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13753.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_2_CVE-2026-13753.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/fa30538a41a7f2860cb7778b721229e52f8c6dd2/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13753.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/278bea3f9397da219bb29098ecf3912d7bfe0645/content/posts/cve-2026-13753.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-13753.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/fc4c6dee3389f7c2d92f9f682d5634871f9f8639/references/CVE-2026-13753-2026-07-06-1905","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/HP_Deskjet_2800_%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E6%9C%BA%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-13753.toml","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bb6223196139bc0688b84a1421e9ebaaf1270e61/2026/CVE-2026-13753.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/c627f818ca26f812f8f09efde01676a81d0688b8/references/contrib1-CVE-2026-13753-2026-07-06-1905","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/9c5d67a198e99294f34c44ceb3609166657a0a6c/CVEs_log/2026-07-07_zh.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-13753"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0057.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0064","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24014","title":"Apache IoTDB DataNode 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Apache IoTDB DataNode 内部 RPC 接口在创建 Trigger 实例时，未对用户上传的 JAR 文件名进行充分校验，直接拼接路径导致路径遍历漏洞。若 DataNode 内部 RPC 端口暴露于不可信网络，攻击者可通过在 JAR 文件名中构造路径穿越序列（如 ../），将文件写入预期安装目录之外的位置，实现任意文件写入。该漏洞影响 Apache IoTDB 1.3.3 至 2.0.8 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害严重。官方建议升级至 2.0.8 版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24014"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T09:16:35Z","updated":"2026-07-07T17:49:04Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache IoTDB 至 2.0.8 及以上版本。同时确保 DataNode RPC 端口（默认 6667）不暴露于不可信网络，通过防火墙限制仅内网访问，并审计已有 Trigger JAR 文件完整性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread/38298f803gb5j9nlhf0l9zkf34o90h3m","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/07/06/12","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24014.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_2_CVE-2026-24014.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24014.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-24014.md","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/688b49dd77e12d8bea3c3d690f69122f8f07c16a/static/projects/iotdb/CVE-2026-24014.osv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-24014.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Apache_IoTDB_%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86_CVE-2026-24014.toml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/4d9fb75e7ff5bbebd0a7f4ae8a906875efb03f1c/references/contrib1-CVE-2026-24014-2026-07-06-2005","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/9c6f35acd5a41ddddf44506d341fe005458d02b2/vulns/apache-iotdb/PYSEC-2026-2081.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-24014.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-24014"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0063","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24013","title":"Apache IoTDB Thrift RPC 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Apache IoTDB 的 Thrift RPC 查询处理器对 sessionId 参数缺乏严格校验，未经认证的远程攻击者可通过构造带有伪造 sessionId 的请求绕过 openSession 身份认证，直接获取合法的时序数据查询结果，导致未授权读取敏感数据。该漏洞影响 Apache IoTDB 1.3.3 至 2.0.8 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。建议升级至 2.0.8 版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24013"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T09:16:35Z","updated":"2026-07-07T17:50:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache IoTDB 至 2.0.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Thrift RPC 会话 ID 校验缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面限制对 IoTDB Thrift RPC 端口的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并启用会话认证日志进行监控。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread/6pwkgnqhbm56mvn309f87snm84s0b75y","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/07/06/11","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24013.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_2_CVE-2026-24013.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24013.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-24013.md","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/688b49dd77e12d8bea3c3d690f69122f8f07c16a/static/projects/iotdb/CVE-2026-24013.osv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-24013.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Apache_IoTDB_%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-24013.toml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/4d9fb75e7ff5bbebd0a7f4ae8a906875efb03f1c/references/contrib1-CVE-2026-24013-2026-07-06-2005","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/9c6f35acd5a41ddddf44506d341fe005458d02b2/vulns/apache-iotdb/PYSEC-2026-2080.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-24013.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-24013"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0062","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24012","title":"Apache IoTDB 极端时间范围查询致堆耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache IoTDB 的 DataNode 接口未对查询的时间范围和聚合间隔施加合理限制，远程攻击者可通过构造极端参数（如超大时间跨度搭配最小聚合间隔）的查询请求，迫使 DataNode 在内存中构建过大的结果集，导致 Java 堆内存耗尽、进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache IoTDB 1.3.3 至 2.0.8 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 2.0.8 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24012"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-06T09:16:35Z","updated":"2026-07-07T17:53:36Z","remediation":"升级到 Apache IoTDB 2.0.8 及以上版本，该版本已对查询时间范围和聚合间隔施加合理限制，防止堆内存耗尽。临时缓解措施：在网关或反向代理层限制对 DataNode 的查询接口访问，并配置 JVM 堆内存上限（-Xmx）以控制单次查询最大内存消耗。建议同时监控查询请求中的时间范围参数，拒绝超过阈值（如时间跨度超过 30 天且聚合间隔小于 1 秒）的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread/0g5th1t2vj6j8hm5t9w3xh9n6f6ht9z8","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/07/06/10","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24012.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_3_CVE-2026-24012.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/fa30538a41a7f2860cb7778b721229e52f8c6dd2/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24012.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-24012.md","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/688b49dd77e12d8bea3c3d690f69122f8f07c16a/static/projects/iotdb/CVE-2026-24012.osv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-24012.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/fc4c6dee3389f7c2d92f9f682d5634871f9f8639/references/CVE-2026-24012-2026-07-06-2005","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Apache_IoTDB_%E6%9E%81%E7%AB%AF%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E8%87%B4%E5%A0%86%E8%80%97%E5%B0%BD%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-24012.toml","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/9c6f35acd5a41ddddf44506d341fe005458d02b2/vulns/apache-iotdb/PYSEC-2026-2079.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be827cc2d99405b0a015aad2694b62cec4eb4f9e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-24012.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-24012"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0272","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0272.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45016","title":"EGroupware Mail 组件文件包含漏洞","description":"EGroupware 邮件 HTML 编辑功能在处理内嵌图片 URL 时，未对 URI scheme 进行充分校验，仅通过 str_starts_with($myUrl, 'http') 判断是否为 HTTP 链接，导致 file:// 协议被绕过检测。攻击者可构造包含 file:// 协议的恶意邮件，利用 file_get_contents() 读取服务器任意本地文件（如 /etc/passwd）并以内联 MIME 附件形式嵌入外发邮件中。该漏洞影响 EGroupware 全版本，攻击者需具备向目标系统发送 HTML 邮件的权限，属于低权限条件下的高危信息泄露漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45016","GHSA-c8m7-r2jv-rw63"],"sources":["cve","ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-07T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 EGroupware 到 26.5.20260507（26.x 分支）或 23.1.20260601（23.x 分支）及以上版本。如无法立即升级，修改 api/src/Mail.php 中 processURL2InlineImages 函数，将 URI 校验由 !str_starts_with($myUrl, 'http') 替换为 if (!preg_match('#^https?://#i', $myUrl)) { continue; }，禁止 file:// 等非 HTTP 协议 URIs 传入 file_get_contents。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/EGroupware/egroupware/security/advisories/GHSA-c8m7-r2jv-rw63","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-c8m7-r2jv-rw63"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0272.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0004","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0004.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"CNNVD 收录漏洞 CNNVD-2026-10183878 安全风险","description":"TRENDnet TEW-432BRP 路由器固件 3.10B20 版本中的 boa Web 服务在处理 /goform/formWlanSetup 接口时，未对 enrollee 参数长度进行校验，直接将用户输入数据拷贝到栈上局部变量，导致栈缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可通过发送特制 HTTP POST 请求触发漏洞，覆盖函数返回地址，实现远程代码执行或导致设备崩溃。该产品已于 2009 年停产（EOL），厂商不提供修复补丁，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CNNVD-2026-10183878"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-06T00:00:00Z","remediation":"无法获取该漏洞的详细信息，包括受影响厂商、产品及漏洞类型，因此无法给出具体的修复建议。建议通过 CNNVD 官方渠道 (www.cnnvd.org.cn) 查询该编号的完整漏洞详情后，再针对性制定修复方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1058","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1058.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"TidGi Desktop 通过恶意 TiddlyWiki 仓库导入导致的远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>TidGi Desktop（基于 TiddlyWiki 的个人知识管理桌面应用）在 0.13.0 及更早版本中存在高危远程代码执行漏洞。其根因在于应用启动 wiki 工作区时，会从磁盘自动加载 tiddlers/ 目录下所有 .tid 文件并注入 wiki store；随后 TiddlyWiki 内核的 defineTiddlerModules() 会自动将带有 module-type 字段的 tiddler 注册为可执行模块，而启动阶段 executeNextStartupTask() 会无条件调用其中 type 为 \"startup\" 模块的 exports.startup() 函数，且该函数在 Node.js Wiki Worker 进程中拥有完整的 require() 权限。攻击者无需身份认证，只需构造一个恶意 TiddlyWiki 仓库，在其中放入一个包含恶意 JavaScript 启动模块的 .tid 文件，并诱导受害者通过\"添加工作区\"克隆或打开该仓库，应用启动时恶意代码便自动执行，可实现任意文件读写、反弹 Shell 及持久化。已在 macOS（TiddlyWiki 5.4.0、Node.js v26）上验证通过 require('child_process').execSync() 成功执行任意系统命令。建议升级至修复版本，并禁止用户 tiddler 定义 module-type 或在沙箱中执行用户模块。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["GHSA-9hc2-hjx8-q6pv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-05T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-05T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 TidGi Desktop 至修复该漏洞的最新版本（目前受影响的最高版本为 0.13.0，请关注 tiddly-gittly/TidGi-Desktop 仓库的修复发布，启用自动更新）。若无法立即升级，可采取以下缓解措施：1) 严禁打开或导入来源不明的 Git 仓库，尤其警惕包含 tiddlers/$__plugins__*__startup.js.tid 等含 module-type: startup 字段的恶意 wiki；2) 在宿主防火墙或系统层限制 TidGi 子进程对网络的访问能力；同时建议在 TiddlyWiki 核心的 defineTiddlerModules() 中增加校验，拒绝用户创建的模块定义 module-type 字段，从而阻断启动期自动执行攻击链。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1058.toml"}]